  "bio": "WormPaste is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in an eclectic mix of geometric, floral, and traditional styles, known to bring each client's vision to life with precision and creativity. Based in Norwich, they can be found crafting their beautiful artwork at Indigo Tattoo Studio, where they are renowned for their professional approach to every project, ensuring a flawless and satisfying tattoo experience. Visitors commend the immaculate environment WormPaste maintains, which is a testament to their dedication to cleanliness and the art of tattooing.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nPaintings and tattoos in Norwich @indigotattoostudio \nHalf of @rootuntootun (ᵔᴥᵔ)\n\nPaintings and tattoos in Norwich @indigotattoostudio \nHalf of @rootuntootun (ᵔᴥᵔ)",
